    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to bring 20 The Moore to the open market for sale. No. 20 is a well presented one bedroom apartment on the 2nd floor of this conveniently located development. It offers light filled accommodation throughout and comes with the benefit of a recently renovated bathroom and a designated car space. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises; Entrance hall, living/dining room, kitchen, bedroom and bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location of this property is superb. Situated on Cathal Brugha Street, Gresham House is a well maintained development, superbly located right in the hub of the city centre. It is convenient to the IFSC, Trinity College, the LUAS, various bus routes and all central places of business. It is also within a minute's stroll of O'Connell Street, the City Centre and all its amenities. The property is further enhanced by the Luas Cross City that passes around the corner from the property. \r\n\r\nCall us now on 01 4964612 to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
